abstract: >-
  Computational workflows for TCGA-THCA miRNA expression-level
  and mature miRNA arm-level (3p/5p) analyses, including data
  acquisition and preprocessing, MIMAT-based isomiR aggregation,
  feature selection, class-imbalance handling, patient-grouped
  nested cross-validation, machine-learning model evaluation,
  TOPSIS ranking, and identification of candidate miRNA
  biomarkers for thyroid cancer.
